<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 13.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices -March 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    91/95     97/101     UNQ     200/203</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   92/97    100/103   198/203   210/215</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker prices on Thursday were quoted lower as easing demand forced sellers to cut offers, traders said. &quot;Sellers to cut offers which later triggered some buying interest,&quot; a major said. A parcel was traded late Thursday at $92 per tonne for 380-cst, he said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
